  - injection-protection
abstract: >-
  PicoDome is a deterministic runtime sandbox and behavioral analysis engine
  for supply-chain security, designed to protect machines (especially LLMs)
  from injection attacks. It couples real kernel-level sandboxing (seccomp-bpf
  on Linux, seatbelt on macOS) with multi-signal behavioral detection — timing
  anomalies, data exfiltration, entropy spikes, honeypot access, and baseline
  drift — to catch threats that static scanners miss. PicoDome is the L3/L4
  runtime companion to PicoSentry (L2 static scanner), completing a layered
  defense-in-depth pipeline from install to execution.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "PicoSentry"
    version: 0.16.0
    url: "https://github.com/KirkForge/PicoSentry"
    description: >-
      L2 deterministic offline npm/pnpm supply-chain scanner — the static
      analysis companion that runs before PicoDome's runtime sandboxing.
